# Laravel Club Rewards Project Structure

This is a Laravel 12 project using Inertia.js with Vue 3 and TypeScript. The main entry point is [artisan](mdc:artisan), which loads configuration from [config/app.php](mdc:config/app.php).

## Core Technologies

- **Laravel 12**: Latest Laravel framework with strict types
- **Inertia.js**: SPA-like experience without API complexity
- **Vue 3 + TypeScript**: Frontend with Composition API
- **Tailwind CSS**: Utility-first CSS framework

## Key Directories

- [app/Actions/](mdc:app/Actions/): Business logic using Laravel Action pattern
- [app/Http/Controllers/](mdc:app/Http/Controllers/): HTTP controllers returning Inertia responses
- [app/Models/](mdc:app/Models/): Eloquent models with relationships
- [resources/js/](mdc:resources/js/): Vue 3 components and TypeScript code
- [database/migrations/](mdc:database/migrations/): Database schema migrations
- [routes/](mdc:routes/): Application routing

## Configuration Files

- [composer.json](mdc:composer.json): PHP dependencies and Laravel configuration
- [package.json](mdc:package.json): Node.js dependencies and build scripts
- [tsconfig.json](mdc:tsconfig.json): TypeScript configuration
- [vite.config.ts](mdc:vite.config.ts): Vite build configuration
